---
const nodes = [
 ['eliciting','Eliciting evidence','蒐集證據','Ask learners to choose A or B, justify the choice, identify the example/link and improve A. A correct choice alone leaves the reasoning uncertain.'],
 ['interpreting','Interpreting evidence','詮釋證據','Compare the response with both learning criteria. Is the issue relevance, explanation or confusing instructions? Treat the inference as provisional.'],
 ['feedback','Formative feedback','形成性回饋','Offer a criterion-focused hint only after an attempt. Give enough help for a useful next step; avoid an automatic grade or an unnecessary explanation for a goal already met.'],
 ['action','Learner/teacher take-up and action','學習者／教師採納與行動','Learners revise and explain the change. Teachers may reteach, offer targeted support, extend or continue. Recheck with a fresh example when evidence is needed.'],
 ['targets','Targets of learning','學習目標','The central reference throughout: a specific relevant example, and an explanation linking it to the claim. Revisit these targets during every practice, rather than treating them as a completed first step.'],
];
---
<div class="framework-flow" aria-label="Formative purpose, formative practice and formative effect">
 <div class="framework-context">Formative purpose<br /><small>Use evidence to support learning</small></div>
 <div class="framework-boundary"><h3>Formative practice</h3><p class="framework-mobile-key">Targets connect with every practice. The practices cycle clockwise; revisit evidence when needed.</p>
  <div class="practice-cycle">
   <svg class="framework-arrows" viewBox="0 0 660 420" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="tirf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#1f6b45" /></marker></defs><g fill="none" stroke="#1f6b45" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#tirf-arrow)"><path d="M400 60 Q565 60 565 150"/><path d="M565 270 Q565 360 400 360"/><path d="M260 360 Q95 360 95 270"/><path d="M95 150 Q95 60 260 60"/></g><g stroke="#1f6b45" stroke-width="1.8" marker-start="url(#tirf-arrow)" marker-end="url(#tirf-arrow)"><path d="M330 125V167"/><path d="M330 253V295"/><path d="M205 210H241"/><path d="M419 210H455"/></g></svg>
   {nodes.map(([key,en,zh])=><button type="button" class={`framework-node node-${key}`} data-framework={key} aria-pressed={key==='targets'} aria-controls="framework-detail"><span data-language="en">{en}</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>{zh}</span></button>)}
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class="framework-context">Formative effect<br /><small>Evaluate whether learning benefits</small></div>
</div>
<div id="framework-detail" class="takeaway" aria-live="polite">{nodes.map(([key,en,,text])=><div data-framework-detail={key} hidden={key!=='targets'}><strong>{en}</strong><p>{text}</p></div>)}</div>
<p class="source-note"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.system.2024.103414">Li &amp; Gu (2024)</a>.</p>
